        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K447-SAV, Ornate Victorian Plate with Crystal Savannah Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking for something that is truly beautiful for your interior doors, the Ornate Victorian Plate with Savannah Knob maybe the end to your search. Every inch of this latchset is dripping with ornate elegance. The Victorian Plate is made out of cast brass while the Savannah Knob is made out of crystal. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/victorian-latchset-brass-accents-d05-k447\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K447-SAV Victorian Collection Latchset with Oblong Savannah Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button and turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
